{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-jumeirah-living-business-bay","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"jumeirah-living-business-bay-select-group","about":"Jumeirah Living Business Bay - a luxury project from developer Select Group, located in the Business Bay business district. The complex is a 35-storey tower on the shores of the Dubai Canal. The design of the complex is made in a modern style, and its main feature are glass inserts, which reflect the rays of the sun and the waters of the canal.The interiors of the complex are decorated with high quality materials and delicate shades prevail. The windows of each residence offer stunning views of the cityscapes and the Dubai Canal.Business Bay has a very developed infrastructure, on the territory of the area residents have access to kindergartens, schools, medical centres, cafes, restaurants and shops. On the territory of JLBB residents will find a swimming pool, gym, yoga and meditation studio, children's play areas, sports fields and a cinema. There are cosy lounge areas for relaxation. There are also apartment cleaning services, concierge and round-the-clock security.The complex has a convenient location in close proximity to the main transport arteries of Dubai - Al Khail Road and Sheikh Zayed Road. Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are just 5 minutes away, Jumeirah Beach is 10 minutes away. Palm Jumeirah and Dubai Marina are approximately 25 minutes' drive away, while Dubai International Airport is 15 minutes' drive away.","price":11061000,"title":"Jumeirah Living Business Bay","bitrix":{"id":463,"pf_id":"are.2.11892","source":null,"project_id":"Jumeirah Living Business Bay","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Business Bay","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Select Group","project_location":"Business Bay"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/jum_living_feature_f52a823bee.webp","464x312":